{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":483593,"name":"Aaron","username":"AaronW","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/b3f665/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-04T19:16:28.434Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483593-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483593-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483593-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483593-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.39.0 on Apple-silicon macOS reports “local machine isn’t connected.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrivacy Mode is explicitly enabled, and I have already restarted, updated, retried, and signed out/in. At approximately 11:09–11:15 AM EDT on September 4, both Grok Bot and sand-local-exec-daemon remained running and maintained established TLS connections to Cursor’s gateway, but the cloud Bot still could not recognize the Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease check and repair this account’s local-machine registration, ownership generation, and local-exec pairing server-side. This appears to match forum topic 170596, where a backend adjustment was required.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483593-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483593-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI loaded up Grok Bot and tried to create a new bot and got consistent disconnect errors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483593-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483593-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483593-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483593-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003cbr\u003e\nVersion: 0.39.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483593-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483593-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:38:10.211Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170632,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-not-connecting-to-local-computer-version-0-39-0","display_username":"Aaron","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136193,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-not-connecting-to-local-computer-version-0-39-0/170632/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":483655,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-04T21:37:52.850Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca clas